#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 535f7fd8a2474b69ad8d78678d97bde2
#: Intervals.ipynb:9 Multiple Time
msgid "Multiple Time Intervals"
msgstr "多个时间区间"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 6fee5b38be1a4d929445d5885f3f8f8d
#: Intervals.ipynb:11 Multiple Time
msgid ""
"You may want to make trading decisions on a different timeframe than your"
" underlying data source. For instance, you might choose to execute trades"
" on daily bars after confirming the trend on weekly or monthly bars. "
"**PyBroker v2** supports compressing backtest data into coarser intervals"
" and making those compressed bars available to your strategy."
msgstr ""
"你可能希望以不同于底层数据源的时间框架来做出交易决策。例如，你可以选择在通过周线或月线确认趋势后，在日线上执行交易。**PyBroker "
"v2** 支持将回测数据压缩为更粗粒度的时间区间，并让这些压缩后的 K 线可供你的策略使用。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 67470c3d89ea4ff8a796e5fde2787911
#: Intervals.ipynb:23 Multiple Time
msgid "Interval Types"
msgstr "区间类型"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:25 Multiple Time
#: e26fd07ed40344118620f6967deb8ebd
msgid "You can define an interval using any of these three formats:"
msgstr "你可以使用以下三种格式中的任意一种来定义时间区间："

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 6203a983e46c43bfafa75bebf2ce5739
#: Intervals.ipynb:27 Multiple Time
msgid ""
"**Every-n-bars** (``int`` greater than ``1``): Compresses every ``n`` "
"base bars into one bar. For example, using ``5`` on daily data produces "
"one bar per five trading days."
msgstr ""
"**每 n 根 K 线** （大于 ``1`` 的 ``int``）：将每 ``n`` 根基础 K "
"线压缩为一根 K 线。例如，在日线数据上使用 ``5`` 会每五个交易日生成一根 K 线。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 0c495f0325a849dc9d1698ae6f3f068e
#: Intervals.ipynb:28 Multiple Time
msgid ""
"**Duration** (``str``): A fixed time span written as digits followed by a"
" single unit letter (``s``, ``m``, ``h``, or ``d``). For example, "
"``\"5m\"`` compresses 1-minute bars into 5-minute bars."
msgstr ""
"**时长** （``str``）：以数字加单个单位字母（``s``、``m``、``h`` 或 ``d``）表示的固定时间跨度。例如，``\"5m\"`` "
"会将 1 分钟 K 线压缩为 5 分钟 K 线。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 2b64a9b129a04e489c187ee4355dbe05
#: Intervals.ipynb:29 Multiple Time
msgid ""
"**Calendar** (``str``): Aligns exactly to standard calendar boundaries "
"using one of the following options:"
msgstr "**日历** （``str``）：使用以下选项之一，精确对齐到标准日历边界："

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:32 Multiple Time
#: bca38f90282444c9a060754d836c01e1
msgid "Calendar String"
msgstr "日历字符串"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:32 Multiple Time
#: cd6d43a8f6c1480cbd36071b32e1bd23
msgid "Boundary Alignment"
msgstr "边界对齐"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:34 Multiple Time
#: a6ed9d5b22b9420d87d0431dfaf24bc4
msgid "``\"daily\"``"
msgstr "``\"daily\"``"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 1f0dac57a38b45e7ba8e4ab663091375
#: Intervals.ipynb:34 Multiple Time
msgid "Standard daily boundary."
msgstr "标准的每日边界。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 8cd869c8a1b74219ade40d8f2f79848e
#: Intervals.ipynb:35 Multiple Time
msgid "``\"weekly\"``"
msgstr "``\"weekly\"``"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:35 Multiple Time
#: d294d2b30d3447238a346fec5ef6f4c4
msgid "Starts on Monday."
msgstr "从周一开始。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 8ee74968363b4682b31de9edb758b533
#: Intervals.ipynb:36 Multiple Time
msgid "``\"monthly\"``"
msgstr "``\"monthly\"``"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 9fcf29ea41e249019f4807202c896341
#: Intervals.ipynb:36 Multiple Time
msgid "Starts on the 1st of the month."
msgstr "从每月 1 日开始。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 2d992a232d2a4260879f2db34fbc1cdb
#: Intervals.ipynb:37 Multiple Time
msgid "``\"quarterly\"``"
msgstr "``\"quarterly\"``"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 168a48931e3a462c9d04a6c5f4a9a8d0
#: Intervals.ipynb:37 Multiple Time
msgid "Begins in January, April, July, and October."
msgstr "从 1 月、4 月、7 月和 10 月开始。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:38 Multiple Time
#: bd466d94eee940978bd5982286cd03bf
msgid "``\"yearly\"``"
msgstr "``\"yearly\"``"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 2d9276c1c07b4f58bdec59618393f0a6
#: Intervals.ipynb:38 Multiple Time
msgid "Starts on January 1."
msgstr "从 1 月 1 日开始。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 2697ee7110c749eb93bec64d91c29f0c
#: Intervals.ipynb:41 Multiple Time
msgid ""
"Your chosen interval must always be strictly coarser than the bars being "
"compressed. For example, if you fetch daily bars from `YFinance "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.data.html#pybroker.data.YFinance>`__,"
" ``\"weekly\"`` and ``\"monthly\"`` are valid intervals. Attempting to "
"use ``\"daily\"`` or ``\"1h\"`` will raise a ``ValueError``."
msgstr ""
"你所选择的时间区间必须始终严格粗于被压缩的 K 线。例如，如果你从 `YFinance "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.data.html#pybroker.data.YFinance>`__"
" 获取日线数据，那么 ``\"weekly\"`` 和 ``\"monthly\"`` 都是有效的时间区间。尝试使用 ``\"daily\"`` 或 "
"``\"1h\"`` 将引发 ``ValueError``。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:43 Multiple Time
#: da7689ba4e1b4d3dab14188a4f3f9c51
msgid ""
"Before using intervals in a strategy, let's build some intuition by "
"compressing bars directly. We will start by downloading daily data:"
msgstr "在策略中使用时间区间之前，让我们先通过直接压缩 K 线来建立一些直观认识。我们将从下载日线数据开始："

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:315 Multiple Time
#: b59f405f814d44d5aeadf4831f66e10c
msgid "Compressing Bars"
msgstr "压缩 K 线"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:317 Multiple Time
#: a51e48e00c0344fdbfef459647345cff
msgid ""
"The `compress_bars "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.interval.html#pybroker.interval.compress_bars>`__"
" function converts single-symbol OHLCV data (either a `Pandas DataFrame "
"<https://pandas.pydata.org/docs/reference/api/pandas.DataFrame.html>`__ "
"or `BarData "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.common.html#pybroker.common.BarData>`__)"
" to a coarser interval, returning the result as a new `BarData "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.common.html#pybroker.common.BarData>`__"
" object. Every compressed bar is timestamped with the date of the last "
"base bar it contains."
msgstr ""
"`compress_bars "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.interval.html#pybroker.interval.compress_bars>`__"
" 函数可将单品种的 OHLCV 数据（可以是 `Pandas DataFrame "
"<https://pandas.pydata.org/docs/reference/api/pandas.DataFrame.html>`__ 或 "
"`BarData "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.common.html#pybroker.common.BarData>`__）"
"转换为更粗粒度的时间区间，并以新的 `BarData "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.common.html#pybroker.common.BarData>`__"
" 对象形式返回结果。每根压缩后的 K 线都以其所包含的最后一根基础 K 线的日期作为时间戳。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:320 Multiple Time
#: f4f89d1cd21a4699bb81f587ec259593
msgid ""
"When grouping base bars into a compressed bar, the data is aggregated as "
"follows:"
msgstr "在将基础 K 线分组为压缩 K 线时，数据将按以下方式聚合："

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:322 Multiple Time
#: ca683b5b28984ed789df9adb0a74f893
msgid "**Open:** Taken from the first base bar."
msgstr "**开盘价：** 取自第一根基础 K 线。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 0c90ae6272814c41b8f4812b926bd58e
#: Intervals.ipynb:323 Multiple Time
msgid "**High / Low:** The highest high and lowest low."
msgstr "**最高价 / 最低价：** 取最高价中的最高值和最低价中的最低值。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:324 Multiple Time
#: b0a4be95c2034b94895e53e299f1c1f0
msgid "**Close:** Taken from the last base bar."
msgstr "**收盘价：** 取自最后一根基础 K 线。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 4e070e88d8be4b43b350a35e0308d771
#: Intervals.ipynb:325 Multiple Time
msgid "**Volume:** The sum of the volumes."
msgstr "**成交量：** 各成交量之和。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:326 Multiple Time
#: f41ff4d99d1a413b9a0332a12d9d87f7
msgid "**VWAP:** The volume-weighted average."
msgstr "**VWAP：** 成交量加权平均价。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 6ee1e199b6cf486ebfe0122140be7519
#: Intervals.ipynb:327 Multiple Time
msgid ""
"**Custom columns:** The last value in the period (e.g., `YFinance "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.data.html#pybroker.data.YFinance>`__'s"
" ``adj_close``)."
msgstr ""
"**自定义列：** 取该周期内的最后一个值（例如 `YFinance "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.data.html#pybroker.data.YFinance>`__"
" 的 ``adj_close``）。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 37ff214747614950bde19a44b43e537f
#: Intervals.ipynb:329 Multiple Time
msgid ""
"You must also supply the ``base_timeframe`` parameter to declare the "
"spacing of your input bars (for example, ``\"1d\"`` for daily data)."
msgstr ""
"你还必须提供 ``base_timeframe`` 参数，以声明输入 K 线的间隔（例如，日线数据对应 ``\"1d\"``）。"

