#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 0c83d37b32294a6ea0b42dc7204f49e9
#: Intervals.ipynb:511 Multiple Time
msgid ""
"Every-n-bars compression works the same way. In this example, every ``5``"
" daily bars become one bar:"
msgstr "每 n 根 K 线压缩的方式相同。在此示例中，每 ``5`` 根日线合并为一根 K 线："

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:687 Multiple Time
#: dfcfba7416504620a1ce4ffc0033d01c
msgid "A Multi-Timeframe Strategy"
msgstr "多时间框架策略"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:689 Multiple Time
#: b7efcf34cb8949afad7c68795eef2b6f
msgid ""
"When building a backtest, you can declare higher timeframes by passing "
"the ``intervals`` parameter to `add_execution "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.add_execution>`__."
" Your execution function can then read these compressed bars through "
"`ctx.interval "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.interval>`__,"
" which returns a read-only `IntervalContext "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.IntervalContext>`__."
msgstr ""
"在构建回测时，你可以通过向 `add_execution "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.add_execution>`__"
" 传递 ``intervals`` 参数来声明更高的时间框架。随后，你的执行函数便可通过 `ctx.interval "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.interval>`__"
" 读取这些压缩后的 K 线，该方法会返回一个只读的 `IntervalContext "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.IntervalContext>`__。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 3122dff221e1437ea6805c9fd3fac911
#: Intervals.ipynb:692 Multiple Time
msgid ""
"Both indicators and models attached to the execution are automatically "
"computed on the base timeframe and across every declared interval. For "
"example, an indicator with a ``period=10`` will instantly have a 10-week "
"version available on the weekly bars, made accessible via the `indicator "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.IntervalContext.indicator>`__"
" method on that context (``ctx.interval(\"weekly\").indicator(...)``)."
msgstr ""
"附加到该执行上的指标和模型都会自动在基础时间框架以及每个已声明的时间区间上计算。例如，一个 ``period=10`` "
"的指标会立即在周线上提供对应的 10 周版本，可通过该上下文的 `indicator "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.IntervalContext.indicator>`__"
" 方法访问（``ctx.interval(\"weekly\").indicator(...)``）。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 175e1964bce147ef8c20e8937919d27f
#: Intervals.ipynb:694 Multiple Time
msgid ""
"To prevent look-ahead bias, `ctx.interval "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.interval>`__"
" only ever exposes *completed* bars. The week or month that is currently "
"forming is never visible, ensuring that future data cannot leak into your"
" daily trading decisions."
msgstr ""
"为防止前视偏差，`ctx.interval "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.interval>`__"
" 只会公开 *已完成* 的 K 线。当前正在形成的这一周或这一月永远不可见，从而确保未来数据不会泄漏到你的每日交易决策中。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. Intervals.ipynb:696 Multiple Time
#: af2ddb5988884ed6b732b5cbb0d091cf
msgid ""
"To demonstrate this, we will execute trades on daily bars and assign a "
"specific job to each higher timeframe:"
msgstr "为了演示这一点，我们将在日线上执行交易，并为每个更高的时间框架分配特定任务："

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 9e69a49bcdf74401a2ff87ea7e72f95e
#: Intervals.ipynb:698 Multiple Time
msgid ""
"**Monthly (Regime):** Only enter when the last completed monthly close is"
" higher than the close from three months ago."
msgstr "**月线（市场状态）：** 仅当最后一根已完成的月线收盘价高于三个月前的收盘价时才建仓。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 0d9349d15ed24f4f8bf745fb5c2fadb5
#: Intervals.ipynb:699 Multiple Time
msgid ""
"**Weekly (Trend):** Only enter when the last completed weekly close is "
"above its 10-week moving average, and exit when it falls below that "
"average."
msgstr ""
"**周线（趋势）：** 仅当最后一根已完成的周线收盘价高于其 10 周移动平均线时才建仓，跌破该均线时平仓。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/15. 466655fa97be4f4bab71a9d8ffe27dbe
#: Intervals.ipynb:700 Multiple Time
msgid ""
"**Daily (Timing):** Enter on the first daily close that crosses above the"
" weekly moving average:"
msgstr "**日线（择时）：** 在第一根上穿周线移动平均线的日线收盘时建仓："
